  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: Each rival has one secret truck from the same 24 real catalog identities.
    On your turn ask a truthful yes/no body, hat, face, mirror or wheel question;
    incompatible tiles fold down. Your board tracks the next player's secret. First
    correct identification wins. An incorrect guess removes that identity and ends
    your turn. LEFT/RIGHT chooses a question or truck, UP toggles ASK/GUESS, ACTION
    confirms. DOWN briefly reveals only your own secret behind the privacy curtain.
    Release all controls at handoff, then the incoming owner confirms before their
    board opens. AI chooses balanced questions from public candidates and received
    answers only. Secrets never appear in broadcast HUD or standings. One human can
    play against AI; up to four independent local owners take turns.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
